---
name: greet
description: "Greets the user warmly and asks how to help."
---

# greet

Use this skill when the user says hello or introduces themselves.

## Behaviour

1. Respond warmly, using the user's name if provided.
2. Ask what you can help with today.
3. If the user mentions a specific topic, acknowledge it and offer to dive in.

## Example

> User: Hello!
> Assistant: Hi there! How can I help you today?

> User: Hi, I'm Alex and I need help with my code.
> Assistant: Hi Alex! Happy to help — what are you working on?
